---
description: Apply when editing Stripe, Polar, or payment webhook handlers
globs:
  - "**/*webhook*"
  - "**/*stripe*"
  - "**/*polar*"
alwaysApply: false
---

Before editing these files, read `.viberaven/agent-context.md` and `.viberaven/mission-map.md`.

Do NOT ship webhook handlers without signature verification, idempotency, test/live-mode separation, and provider receipt requirements. Use `stripe-webhooks` and list any provider dashboard action still needed.
